<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Velez Sarsfield</p>
<p>(Argentina) and Santos (Brazil) drew 1-1 (halftime 1-0) in a</p>
<p>South American Supercup semi-final, second leg match played</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Velez Sarsfield - Martin Posse (26th minute)</p>
<p>Santos - Robert (78th)</p>
<p>Velez Sarsfield win 3-2 on aggregate. Velez meet Cruzeiro</p>
<p>(Brazil) in the final.</p>
</text>
